    <div class="itdgl-clinic-intro">
      <p>Meta + Google ads for a haircare + trichology clinic in Nashik, Maharashtra target long-cycle patients researching hair loss for 4-12 weeks before booking. Different playbook than dermatology — nurture-heavy retargeting + educational-content-first + WhatsApp long-cycle follow-up. This FAQ answers 12 questions Nashik trichology clinics ask.</p>
