    <div class="itdgl-evidence-band">
      <strong>ITD CLINIC MARKETING &mdash; WHAT WE ACTUALLY DO:</strong>
      ITD GrowthLabs runs full-stack digital marketing for haircare + trichology + hair loss clinics across Thane, Mumbai, Navi Mumbai, Dombivli, Kalyan, Nagpur, Nashik, and Pune. Social media management + Reels + viral content, Meta + Google ads, website + online booking + WhatsApp Cloud API integration, Google Business Profile optimisation + local SEO, and patient lead generation. We work with clinics that don't have in-house marketing teams — treating the marketing function as an outsourced growth partner, not a vendor. Every answer below reflects live clinic work.
    </div>

    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What channel mix for Meta + Google ads for a Nashik trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Meta + Instagram + Reels 40-45%, Google Search + Ads 20-25%, YouTube ads (long-form + Shorts) 10-15%, WhatsApp CTWA 10-15%, GMB local ads 8-12%. Trichology skews higher YouTube share than dermatology because hair-loss patients research long-form video extensively.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What CPL should we expect for trichology ads in Nashik?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">In Nashik: Rs 200-600 general hair-loss inquiry, Rs 400-1,000 PRP/GFC-specific, Rs 600-1,500 comprehensive hair-loss consultation. Lead-to-booked-consultation 25-40% (higher with WhatsApp nurture). Cost per booked consultation Rs 600-3,000. Consultation-to-treatment 25-50%. Effective cost per acquired patient Rs 2,500-12,000. Higher than dermatology because long-cycle. Compensated by higher LTV (Rs 60,000-5 lakh over 24-36 months for retained patient (long-cycle treatment)).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What is a realistic monthly ad budget for a Nashik trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Rs 30,000-2.8 lakh. Starter Rs 30-80K/month Nashik for solo Rs 3-10 lakh revenue. Growth Rs 80K-2.5L for 2-3 doctor Rs 10-40 lakh. Enterprise Rs 2.5-6L for multi-location. Rule 15-25% during acquisition growth phase, 8-15% mature.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What creative formats work best for trichology paid ads?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Meta + Instagram + Reels: (1) Compliance-safe before-after growth timeline Reels, (2) Hair-loss educational Reels + carousels, (3) PRP/GFC procedure video, (4) Trichologist testimonial + credentials, (5) Patient journey video (with consent). YouTube long-form: patient journey 3-8 min + trichologist FAQ. Google Search: text + sitelinks + call + location + review snippets.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What compliance rules apply to trichology paid ads?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Hair-regrowth claims substantiated. PRP/GFC/mesotherapy non-miracle. Before-after with consent + disclaimer + timeline. No guaranteed outcomes. No comparative claims. In Nashik, Maharashtra Medical Council + Maharashtra FDA + NMC (Nashik Municipal Corporation) enforcement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does CAPI + attribution setup work for a Nashik trichology clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same server-side stack as dermatology + long-cycle attribution model (30-180 day attribution window vs 7-30 day for immediate-purchase categories). Multi-touch attribution essential — trichology buyer touches 6-15 times over 4-12 weeks pre-booking.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we handle attribution + LTV/CAC for trichology paid ads?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">CRM + long-cycle attribution + 24-month LTV cohort. Trichology 24-month LTV Rs 60,000-5 lakh over 24-36 months for retained patient (long-cycle treatment). Payback 4-8 months (longer than dermatology). LTV-weighted bidding essential — first-consultation CPA optimisation misses long-cycle value.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we control ad fatigue for trichology paid ads?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Creative velocity 6-12 units/week Growth. Audience + creative refresh 3-4 weeks. Frequency cap 3-5/week. Exclude converted from prospecting. Long-cycle nurture prevents drop-off during 6-12 month treatment.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What are common paid-ads mistakes for Nashik trichology clinics?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) First-consultation CPA vs long-cycle LTV bidding. (2) Low creative velocity. (3) No Meta CAPI. (4) Weak landing pages + no long-cycle nurture. (5) No WhatsApp CTWA + long-cycle flow. (6) ASCI-violating hair-regrowth guarantee copy. (7) English-only in Nashik. (8) No YouTube long-form ads. (9) Same creative for all hair-loss types. (10) Ignoring seasonal Monsoon peak.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What peak-season ad spend concentration for Nashik trichology?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Diwali + wedding season + Winter + Kumbh Mela cycle + Ganesh Chaturthi + wine harvest season. Monsoon (June-Sep) is major hair-loss peak (increased fall + inquiries lift 40-60%). Post-Diwali + wedding (Nov-Feb) secondary peak. Off-peak Feb-April + Oct = baseline nurture.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What KPIs to track weekly for trichology paid ads?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same as dermatology + long-cycle metrics: 30/60/90/180-day booking attribution + cohort revenue + long-cycle nurture engagement + WhatsApp response rate.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD run Meta + Google ads for Nashik trichology clinics?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Full-stack: channel mix + creative (6-12 units/week) + long-cycle CAPI + attribution + LTV/CAC dashboard + WhatsApp CTWA long-cycle nurture + landing-page CRO + weekly review + monthly QBR. Compliance-safe hair-regrowth creative + ASCI review. Bundled with full retainer (Rs 28,000-1.8 lakh) + transparent ad-spend.</div>
      </div>
